{"law":"苗栗縣-GL000121","name":"苗栗縣都市危險及老舊建築物加速重建建蔽率及建築物高度放寬標準","region":"苗栗縣","source":"https://law.miaoli.gov.tw/glrsnewsout/LawContentHistoryList.aspx?id=GL000121","note":"歷次版本取自該縣市法規系統「歷史法規」；promulgated 是異動（發布）日期。施行日：自治法規依地方制度法第 32 條為發布日起算第三日，條文定有日期者依其日期；行政規則（要點、原則等）未明定者不推定（effectiveKnown=false）。無法切分條號的舊版只存 fullText。","currentPromulgated":null,"currentHash":"3774a62adc06c9ae7b1b7ffcc00a1c86de23a8778032985255d4e046cf266ba9","texts":{"5db08a46d5d6df16":"本標準依都市危險及老舊建築物加速重建條例（以下簡稱本條例）第七條\n\n規定訂定之。","d06bcff826a616b7":"依本條例申請重建之案件，得放寬建蔽率，但以住宅區之基地為限，且不\n\n得超過原建蔽率。\n\n依本標準放寬建蔽率之案件，仍應符合建築法令及都市計畫法令之退縮建\n\n築規定。","fc7a4eb5302bedcc":"依本條例申請重建之案件，其建築物高度，除因飛航安全管制外，不受建\n\n築法令及都市計畫法令之建築高度限制。","0760487a7e1a3f98":"本標準自發布日施行。"},"versions":[{"promulgated":null,"url":"https://law.miaoli.gov.tw/glrsnewsout/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000121","effective":null,"effectiveKnown":false,"effectiveBasis":"無發布日期","exceptions":{},"current":true,"changed":{"第 1 條":"5db08a46d5d6df16","第 2 條":"d06bcff826a616b7","第 3 條":"fc7a4eb5302bedcc","第 4 條":"0760487a7e1a3f98"},"removed":[],"articleOrder":["第 1 條","第 2 條","第 3 條","第 4 條"],"articleCount":4}],"articles":{"第 1 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"5db08a46d5d6df16","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 2 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"d06bcff826a616b7","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 3 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"fc7a4eb5302bedcc","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 4 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"0760487a7e1a3f98","version":null,"promulgated":null}]}}
